你说的那个是网贷吧。","beginTime":37738,"endTime":39348,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":17,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":39348,"endTime":39527,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":18,"text":"那我我们应该不会比网贷高吧，","beginTime":39527,"endTime":41851,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":19,"text":"因为我们这边是车主贷。","beginTime":41851,"endTime":43640,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":20,"text":"而且你明确了解过的网站上很多，","beginTime":45920,"endTime":48653,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":21,"text":"他只是把那个利率反思到那个店面，","beginTime":48653,"endTime":51583,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":22,"text":"他们真正要借的。","beginTime":51583,"endTime":52950,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":23,"text":"因为我我只要看我只看利息，","beginTime":52950,"endTime":55293,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":24,"text":"我就知道了哦哦，","beginTime":55293,"endTime":56660,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":25,"text":"这样啊，","beginTime":56660,"endTime":57246,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":26,"text":"还有那个浦发贷也是提不发，","beginTime":57246,"endTime":59589,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":27,"text":"你们跟那个浦发银行做那个什么的吗？","beginTime":59589,"endTime":62744,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":28,"text":"不有合作的吗？","beginTime":62744,"endTime":63920,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":29,"text":"为什么他那里的利率比你们这里的利率还低的哦，","beginTime":63920,"endTime":68528,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":30,"text":"他大概能给到多少，","beginTime":68528,"endTime":70360,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":31,"text":"他给到的是好像是呃，","beginTime":71100,"endTime":74254,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":32,"text":"五点几吧。","beginTime":74254,"endTime":75192,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":33,"text":"哦这样啊，","beginTime":75192,"endTime":76130,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":34,"text":"那一般一般银行才能够给到五点几八九八嘛。","beginTime":76130,"endTime":80586,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":35,"text":"哦跟也是跟你们合作的嘛，","beginTime":80586,"endTime":83166,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":36,"text":"那浦联贷还是什么招生代价，","beginTime":83166,"endTime":85980,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":37,"text":"就是跟你们合作的那一种。","beginTime":85980,"endTime":88560,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":38,"text":"哦，","beginTime":89340,"endTime":89531,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":39,"text":"这样哈哦那行吧，","beginTime":89531,"endTime":90871,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":40,"text":"您可以，","beginTime":90871,"endTime":91445,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":41,"text":"您看您大概是月底月底什么时候需要吧？","beginTime":91445,"endTime":94700,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":42,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":95180,"endTime":96180,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":43,"text":"反正是下个月二十号之前吧，","beginTime":97200,"endTime":99264,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":44,"text":"下个月二十号之前。","beginTime":99264,"endTime":100641,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":45,"text":"对哦哦，","beginTime":100641,"endTime":101157,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":46,"text":"行吧行吧，","beginTime":101157,"endTime":101845,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":47,"text":"您到时候如果有需要，","beginTime":101845,"endTime":103394,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":48,"text":"确实可以先对比嘛。","beginTime":103394,"endTime":104771,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":49,"text":"如果有需要的话，","beginTime":104771,"endTime":105975,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":50,"text":"直接联系我们这。","beginTime":105975,"endTime":107180,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":51,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":107420,"endTime":107618,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":52,"text":"好嘞好嘞，","beginTime":107618,"endTime":108412,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":53,"text":"哎哎哎，","beginTime":108412,"endTime":109008,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":54,"text":"好嘞，","beginTime":109008,"endTime":109405,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":55,"text":"打扰再见。","beginTime":109405,"endTime":110200,"channelId":0}]}',100,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,'2026-05-22 01:11:32','2026-05-22 01:11:35','2026-05-22 01:11:28','2026-05-22 01:11:35','system','system','BATCH-20260522-030772',NULL),
