要呢？","beginTime":17970,"endTime":19300,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":18,"text":"我的资金太少了，","beginTime":20180,"endTime":21776,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":19,"text":"我看着嗯呃，","beginTime":21776,"endTime":23060,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":20,"text":"您当前是一个两万八千三百元的额度，","beginTime":23060,"endTime":25940,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":21,"text":"您这笔就是您大概那个资金需求的话是多少呢？","beginTime":25940,"endTime":29540,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":22,"text":"哥六千万吗？","beginTime":29540,"endTime":31460,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":23,"text":"六七万呃，","beginTime":31700,"endTime":32394,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":24,"text":"您名下的话，","beginTime":32394,"endTime":33261,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":25,"text":"还有没有一些其他的一个车辆呢？","beginTime":33261,"endTime":35691,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":26,"text":"就是价格高一点的，","beginTime":35691,"endTime":37080,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":27,"text":"没有了没有了哦，","beginTime":37320,"endTime":38520,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":28,"text":"没有了。","beginTime":38520,"endTime":39035,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":29,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":39035,"endTime":39206,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":30,"text":"他是这样子的，","beginTime":39206,"endTime":40235,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":31,"text":"因为目前的话它这个呃额度的话，","beginTime":40235,"endTime":42636,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":32,"text":"它是根据你的车子一个车估价来定型的嘛。","beginTime":42636,"endTime":45724,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":33,"text":"然后这边当之前的话，","beginTime":45724,"endTime":47267,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":34,"text":"现在只是初始的一个额度，","beginTime":47267,"endTime":49154,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":35,"text":"然后他这边还要过一个审核。","beginTime":49154,"endTime":51212,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":36,"text":"审核通过之后，","beginTime":51212,"endTime":52241,"cha