ent","index":56,"text":"让家里人帮你拍个照片，","beginTime":92034,"endTime":94100,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":57,"text":"家人都在在都在这里，","beginTime":94680,"endTime":96413,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":58,"text":"都没在，","beginTime":96413,"endTime":96991,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":59,"text":"都都都没在老家哦，","beginTime":96991,"endTime":98531,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":60,"text":"都没在老家呀。","beginTime":98531,"endTime":99687,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":61,"text":"嗯行驶证是没有报行驶证啊嗯当行驶证的话不行，","beginTime":99687,"endTime":103731,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":62,"text":"因为您上传不上来的。","beginTime":103731,"endTime":105464,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":63,"text":"因为咱们这这个车子代码这边是需要用到一个绿本的，","beginTime":105464,"endTime":109894,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":64,"text":"绿本一车子的身份证吗？","beginTime":109894,"endTime":111820,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":65,"text":"你这上面利息也太高了吧，","beginTime":112360,"endTime":114131,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":66,"text":"一千块钱，","beginTime":114131,"endTime":114775,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":67,"text":"一千六毛多余余余，","beginTime":114775,"endTime":116632,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":68,"text":"目前的话是两万八千三百元嘛。","beginTime":116632,"endTime":119980,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":69,"text":"两万八千三百元的话，","beginTime":120000,"endTime":121483,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":70,"text":"咱们车主贷的话是默认的一个三十六期。","beginTime":121483,"endTime":124285,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":71,"text":"但是不是说让你这边三十六期全部用完哈哥，","beginTime":124285,"endTime":127418,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":72,"text":"你这边用个一年半载，","beginTime":127418,"endTime":128901,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":73,"text":"在资资金周转回来的话，","beginTime":128901,"endTime":130550,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":74,"text":"你这边选择几年还清就可以了。","beginTime":130550,"endTime":132693,"channel