{"speakerRole":"agent","index":17,"text":"所有人看到的都是一样的。","beginTime":27926,"endTime":29844,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":18,"text":"你需要填写你的份资料之后，","beginTime":29844,"endTime":31936,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":19,"text":"我们要进入人工审核。","beginTime":31936,"endTime":33506,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":20,"text":"人工审核通过的话，","beginTime":33506,"endTime":34901,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":21,"text":"说明你能办理这个月落，","beginTime":34901,"endTime":36644,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":22,"text":"那他才会给您出具体利息。","beginTime":36644,"endTime":38562,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":23,"text":"我现在还不知道你能不能办理的。","beginTime":38562,"endTime":41003,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":24,"text":"所以说你看到的这个利息不是你个人利息，","beginTime":41003,"endTime":44142,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":25,"text":"他理解我那个额度也不够，","beginTime":44142,"endTime":46060,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":26,"text":"你加到我的吗？","beginTime":46520,"endTime":48131,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":27,"text":"哥太少呃，","beginTime":48131,"endTime":50072,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":28,"text":"你大概需要多少额度吗？","beginTime":50072,"endTime":52000,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":29,"text":"八浪费八万块钱，","beginTime":52820,"endTime":54962,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":30,"text":"没问没问题的呀。","beginTime":54962,"endTime":56367,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":31,"text":"哥，","beginTime":56367,"endTime":56568,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":32,"text":"我按照你这个就是需求往上提就行了呀，","beginTime":56568,"endTime":59980,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":33,"text":"给你往上报吗？","beginTime":60220,"endTime":61760,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":34,"text":"你这边的话就说可以直接在支付宝上面填写一下你个人资料，","beginTime":62000,"endTime":66379,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":35,"text":"然后我们这边人工审核通过的话，","beginTime":66379,"endTime":68738,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":36,"text":"那我们直接按照你的需求往这个上，","beginTime":68738,"endTime":71264,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":37,"text":"呃，","beginTime":71264,"endTime":71433,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":38,"text":"按照八万块钱嘛，","beginTime":71433,"endTime":72612,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":39,"text":"你们往上报可以吧？","beginTime":72612,"endTime":73960,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":40,"text":"你的利息这增长是多少啊？","beginTime":76900,"endTime":79880,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":41,"text":"正常的话，","beginTime":80180,"endTime":80929,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":42,"text":"一万块钱应该是在两块到三块钱左右。","beginTime":80929,"endTime":83925,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":43,"text":"具体的话要看你这个真实情况。","beginTime":83925,"endTime":86360,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":44,"text":"这个学费比外面网贷要便宜很多。","beginTime":86360,"endTime":88982,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":45,"text":"你看一下你外面网贷的话，","beginTime":88982,"endTime":91043,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":46,"text":"一万块钱，","beginTime":91043,"endTime":91792,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":47,"text":"一天的话是五块到四块钱的，","beginTime":91792,"endTime":94039,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":48,"text":"好理解吧。","beginTime":94039,"endTime":94788,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":49,"text":"要说一段不止的，","beginTime":94788,"endTime":96100,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":50,"text":"等我现在我爸家再联系你们，","beginTime":97660,"endTime":100240,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":51,"text":"你如果说需要的话，","beginTime":100900,"endTime":102312,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":52,"text":"直接在那个支付宝上面操作就可以了。","beginTime":102312,"endTime":105138,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":53,"text":"因为我这边是协助你确认放款的。","beginTime":105138,"endTime":107610,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":54,"text":"如果说有问题，","beginTime":107610,"endTime":108669,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":55,"text":"或者您这边的话，","beginTime":108669,"endTime":109905,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":56,"text":"遇到什么呃银行卡到了呀，","beginTime":109905,"endTime":111848,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":57,"text":"你可以联系我，","beginTime":111848,"endTime":112907,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":58,"text":"我这边给您解决客户的话，","beginTime":112907,"endTime":114850,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":59,"text":"就是让操作这个绝对是比你在外面网站要便宜的哥。","beginTime":114850,"endTime":120070,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":60,"text":"这个你可以放心，","beginTime":120070,"endTime":121220,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":61,"text":"你反正你可以申请资料嘛。","beginTime":121540,"endTime":123344,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":62,"text":"你认为审核批过之后，","beginTime":123344,"endTime":124821,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":63,"text":"你觉得合适，","beginTime":124821,"endTime":125641,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":64,"text":"你再提他也不合适，","beginTime":125641,"endTime":126954,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":65,"text":"不用就行了呀。","beginTime":126954,"endTime":127938,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":66,"text":"对你来说没有任何印象的好理解吧。","beginTime":127938,"endTime":130400,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":67,"text":"我知道了。","beginTime":131400,"endTime":132026,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":68,"text":"好吧。","beginTime":132026,"endTime":132339,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":69,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":132339,"endTime":132496,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":70,"text":"行，","beginTime":132496,"endTime":132652,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":71,"text":"那我先加一下您的微信吧，","beginTime":132652,"endTime":134375,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":72,"text":"后面有什么问题，","beginTime":134375,"endTime":135471,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":73,"text":"或者你后面需要的时候联系我。","beginTime":135471,"endTime":137506,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":74,"text":"好吧，","begin