{"speakerRole":"agent","index":17,"text":"咱们这台车有没有抵押后的安全呢？","beginTime":29216,"endTime":32080,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":18,"text":"啊，","beginTime":32600,"endTime":33060,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":19,"text":"没有嗯没有，","beginTime":33060,"endTime":34925,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":20,"text":"大部分现在正在身边的啊，","beginTime":34925,"endTime":37072,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":21,"text":"那咱们在这边可以。","beginTime":37072,"endTime":38633,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":22,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":38633,"endTime":38828,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":23,"text":"上边，","beginTime":38828,"endTime":39219,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":24,"text":"那咱们这个这边是可以符合办理的啊。","beginTime":39219,"endTime":42342,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":25,"text":"嗯行，","beginTime":42342,"endTime":42732,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":26,"text":"我用的时候就会就就会从上面取了。","beginTime":42732,"endTime":45660,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":27,"text":"嗯嗯，","beginTime":45960,"endTime":46456,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":28,"text":"我用的时候，","beginTime":46456,"endTime":47697,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":29,"text":"我就从上面先先取一些呃，","beginTime":47697,"endTime":50808,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":30,"text":"他咱们这个是车贷，","beginTime":50808,"endTime":52476,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":31,"text":"就是说他是一次性放款的。","beginTime":52476,"endTime":54768,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":32,"text":"现在呢，","beginTime":54768,"endTime":55394,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":33,"text":"他还还是还没通过这笔资金，","beginTime":55394,"endTime":57895,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":34,"text":"还是用不了的。","beginTime":57895,"endTime":59146,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":35,"text":"就是说你需要用的话，","beginTime":59146,"endTime":60980,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":36,"text":"就是说要提交一下那个行驶证照片跟大本的照片，","beginTime":60980,"endTime":65099,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":37,"text":"咱们把额度激活了之后，","beginTime":65099,"endTime":67061,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":38,"text":"后期要的时候再再呃利年利年利率，","beginTime":67061,"endTime":70003,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":39,"text":"年利率是多少？","beginTime":70003,"endTime":71180,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":40,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":71860,"endTime":72075,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":41,"text":"目前你还没提交资料是看不到的呃，","beginTime":72075,"endTime":75308,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":42,"text":"大概他的利率是多少，","beginTime":75308,"endTime":77248,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":43,"text":"大概呃咱们最最低的一个是十八，","beginTime":77248,"endTime":80592,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":44,"text":"最高的是二十三点九四啊。","beginTime":80592,"endTime":83834,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":45,"text":"你跟我说，","beginTime":83834,"endTime":84613,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":46,"text":"你你不要跟我说这个东西就是百分比比例。","beginTime":84613,"endTime":88120,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":47,"text":"呃，","beginTime":88820,"endTime":89031,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":48,"text":"六月大一个月大概多少吧，","beginTime":89031,"endTime":91360,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":49,"text":"六零到九零左右，","beginTime":92060,"endTime":93800,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":50,"text":"六厘的六里哦，","beginTime":94080,"endTime":96188,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":51,"text":"嗯啊因六十六到九九六就不考虑用了，","beginTime":96188,"endTime":99513,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":52,"text":"这个比樱花还高。","beginTime":99513,"endTime":100788,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":53,"text":"我这边给银行那边更低啊，","beginTime":100788,"endTime":102793,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":54,"text":"谢谢啊。","beginTime":102793,"endTime":103340,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":55,"text":"银行那边的的话，","beginTime":103640,"endTime":104988,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":56,"text":"他是要需要产品征信，","beginTime":104988,"endTime":106722,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":57,"text":"就是说征信能能符合办理的话，","beginTime":106722,"endTime":109226,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":58,"text":"咱们是可以办理。","beginTime":109226,"endTime":110575,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":59,"text":"就是说咱们这边也现在就是说你目前的这个征信资质呢，","beginTime":110575,"endTime":115198,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":60,"text":"就是说办理不了的。","beginTime":115198,"endTime":116740,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":61,"text":"咱们那个台嗯那个的话两两年多，","beginTime":117240,"endTime":120612,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":62,"text":"他们那个现在的话，","beginTime":120612,"endTime":122540,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":63,"text":"那么两米多，","beginTime":123860,"endTime":124840,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":64,"text":"你能比银行做的低吗？","beginTime":124840,"endTime":126605,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":65,"text":"我银行那边是三点零五跟房贷一个利率嗯，","beginTime":126605,"endTime":131123,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":66,"text":"咱们这个车贷，","beginTime":131123,"endTime":132225,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":67,"text":"你说跟房贷的话，","beginTime":132225,"endTime":133510,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":68,"text":"肯定是车会高一点啊。","beginTime":133510,"endTime":136080,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":69,"text":"对，","beginTime":136080,"endTime":136800,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":70,"text":"嗯，","beginTime":137140,"endTime":137457,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":71,"text":"好，","beginTime":137457,"endTime":137775,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":72,"text":"谢谢啊。","beginTime":137775,"endTime":138728,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":73,"text":"嗯嗯，","beginTime":138728,"endTime":139364,"channelId":0},{"speakerRole":"agent","index":74,"text":"好嘞。","beginTime":139364,"endTime":140000,"channelId":0}]}',100,NULL,NULL,0,0